1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,878
Grease trapped between the glass of your
oven door?

2
00:00:03,239 --> 00:00:04,423
You can reach it.

3
00:00:04,633 --> 00:00:05,236
One.

4
00:00:05,527 --> 00:00:08,280
With the oven cool, lock the hinges and

5
00:00:08,290 --> 00:00:09,647
lift the door off.

6
00:00:10,798 --> 00:00:12,120
Take photos.

7
00:00:12,333 --> 00:00:13,005
Two.

8
00:00:13,181 --> 00:00:16,375
Remove the top screws, lift the trim, and

9
00:00:16,385 --> 00:00:18,381
slide out the glass panes.

10
00:00:18,567 --> 00:00:19,239
Three.

11
00:00:19,693 --> 00:00:23,375
Wash each pane with soapy water, then
reassemble

12
00:00:23,385 --> 00:00:24,661
in the same order.

13
00:00:24,867 --> 00:00:26,550
Full guide on the channel.
